  {
   "id": "examples-lambdas-md-5",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "That program fails to compile because of its last line: an inline lambda on the\nright of `|>` is a parse error (`Pipeline right side must be function`). Bind it\nfirst:\n",
